# Width at half contrast of the Airy line with round-trip coefficient t a: 0.08060 nm, Q = 19231.
# For a sharp resonance this tends to lambda^2 (1 - t a) / (pi ng L sqrt(t a)).

title All-pass ring: linewidth and quality factor
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=3
sweep 1.545 1.555 16001
feature 0.5

comp c coupler kappa=0.05
comp w waveguide length=62.8318530718
link c.4 w.1
link w.2 c.2
port in c.1
port through c.3

expect passive
expect fwhm through dips 0.080600 0.01
